&lt;span class="na"&gt;title&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nl"&gt;isOpen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;boolean&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nl"&gt;confirmText&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;?:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nl"&gt;cancelText&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;?:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nl"&gt;destructive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;?:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;boolean&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nl"&gt;onConfirm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;void&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nl"&gt;onCancel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;void&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;};&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;export&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;ConfirmDialog&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;React&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;FC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;React&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;PropsWithChildren&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;ConfirmDialogProps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;({&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nx"&gt;title&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nx"&gt;isOpen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nx"&gt;confirmText&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;OK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nx"&gt;cancelText&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;Cancel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nx"&gt;destructive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nx"&gt;onConfirm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nx"&gt;onCancel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="nx"&gt;children&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;})&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;if &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;isOpen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;return &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;div&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;className&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"fixed inset-0 z-50"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;div&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;className&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"fixed inset-0 bg-black/50"&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;onClick&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;onCancel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;div&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;className&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"fixed inset-0 flex items-center justify-center p-4"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;div&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"dialog"&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;aria-modal&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;className&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"w-full max-w-md rounded-lg bg-white shadow-xl"&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;onClick&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;stopPropagation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;div&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;className&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"border-b p-4 text-lg font-semibold"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;title&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;div&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;div&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;className&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"p-4"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;children&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;div&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;div&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;className&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"flex justify-end gap-2 border-t p-3"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;button&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;className&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"rounded-md bg-gray-200 px-3 py-2 text-sm hover:bg-gray-300"&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;onClick&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;onCancel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;cancelText&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;button&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;button&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;className&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;rounded-md px-3 py-2 text-sm text-white&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;destructive&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;].&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;join&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="dl"&gt;"&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;onClick&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;onConfirm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;confirmText&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;button&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;div&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;div&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;div&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;div&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;};&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// Good example&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;ConfirmDialog&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;title&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;"Delete this item."&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;isOpen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;open&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;destructive&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;onConfirm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;doDelete&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="na"&gt;onCancel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nf"&gt;setOpen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
This operation can not be canceled.
&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nc"&gt;ConfirmDialog&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;The principle is to perform abstraction “only to the minimum necessary extent.” When the use case is limited, actively concretize props to improve readability and consistency.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Building an ecommerce website for agriculture products like seeds, fertilizers, and farm equipment requires a clean UI and scalable frontend architecture.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Many developers spend weeks designing product pages, carts, and responsive layouts. To simplify this process, I built &lt;strong&gt;AgriPro – a modern Agriculture Ecommerce React template built using React and Tailwind CSS.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;AgriPro is designed for developers who want to quickly launch agriculture-focused ecommerce websites without spending weeks building UI components from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;




&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Build a Specialized Agriculture Ecommerce Template?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Most ecommerce templates are designed for generic online stores like fashion or electronics. Agriculture stores, however, often need a different visual approach:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nature-inspired UI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear product categorization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile-friendly product browsing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simple cart and checkout structure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;AgriPro focuses on these needs while keeping the frontend architecture clean and developer-friendly.&lt;/p&gt;




&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Built for Developers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;AgriPro is not just a visual design. It’s structured as a &lt;strong&gt;modern React frontend project&lt;/strong&gt; that developers can easily integrate into their own ecommerce backend or API.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The template follows a component-based structure so developers can reuse UI components across different pages.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;• Clean and scalable React component structure&lt;br&gt;
• Tailwind CSS for rapid styling and customization&lt;br&gt;
• Mobile-first responsive design&lt;br&gt;
• Reusable UI components&lt;br&gt;
• Easy integration with any backend (Node.js, Laravel, Firebase, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;AgriPro uses modern frontend technologies that many developers already work with.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frontend Framework&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
React&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Styling Framework&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Tailwind CSS&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Component-based UI structure&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsive Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Mobile-first layout optimized for all devices&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features Included in the Template&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;AgriPro includes essential ecommerce UI components needed for most online stores.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Homepage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
A modern landing page designed to highlight products and categories.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Listing Page&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Clean grid layout to showcase multiple agriculture products such as seeds or fertilizers.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Details Page&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Detailed product view with images, description, and pricing.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shopping Cart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Interactive cart UI for adding and managing products.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wishlist&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Wishlist component for saving favorite products.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fully Responsive Layout&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Works seamlessly across mobile, tablet, and desktop screens.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Designed for Agriculture Businesses&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This template is suitable for projects such as:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;• Seed ecommerce websites&lt;br&gt;
• Organic farming product stores&lt;br&gt;
• Agriculture equipment shops&lt;br&gt;
• Fertilizer and pesticide ecommerce stores&lt;br&gt;
• Farming marketplace platforms&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Developers building solutions for agriculture startups or farm product sellers can quickly adapt this UI.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Easy to Customize&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;AgriPro is built using Tailwind CSS utility classes, which makes customization simple.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You can easily modify:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;• Color themes&lt;br&gt;
• Layout spacing&lt;br&gt;
• Typography&lt;br&gt;
• UI components&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Developers can quickly adapt the design to match different brand identities.&lt;/p&gt;

